Remember to link your CSS file to your HTML file using the `<link>` tag in the `<head>` section of your HTML file.

4. **Adding more features**: Depending on your needs, there are many other features you could add. For example, you could add a button to clear the table, or a dropdown to choose the temperature scale (Celsius, Fahrenheit, Kelvin, etc.). You could also add a search bar to filter the table by date, time, or temperature.

