4. **Send the clicked data to Django**: Finally, you can use AJAX to send the clicked data back to Django:

```html
<script>
 myPlot.on('plotly_click', function(data){
 var x = data.points[0].x;
 var y = data.points[0].y;

 $.ajax({
 url: '/your-django-url/',
